{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_37","type":"agent_message","text":"I’m adding the differential harness now. It loads both shared objects with `libloading`, copies only their exported C function pointers, executes every call in an isolated forked child, and compares exit code or exact signal plus stdout and stderr bytes; fixed-seed generators cover signed values and `scanf` input shapes without ever linking to or directly calling the Rust crate."}}
